{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_019Qg4AaCeY9FnCyzLT82vyM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've successfully implemented US-007 - Google OAuth login. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\n### Files Created\n- **`src/app/[locale]/complete-profile/page.tsx`** - Server component for the complete profile page\n- **`src/app/[locale]/complete-profile/complete-profile-content.tsx`** - Client component with username setup form for first-time Google users\n\n### Files Modified\n- **`src/app/auth/callback/route.ts`** - Updated to detect first-time Google users and redirect them to set their username\n- **`messages/en.json`** - Added English translations for complete-profile flow\n- **`messages/es.json`** - Added Spanish translations for complete-profile flow\n\n### Acceptance Criteria Met\n- [x] **Google OAuth configured in Supabase** - The existing `signInWithOAuth` with provider \"google\" is already in `login-form.tsx`\n- [x] **Sign in with Google button on login page** - Already present in `login-form.tsx`\n- [x] **First-time Google users prompted to set their unique username** - New `/complete-profile` page with username form\n- [x] **Username uniqueness enforced for Google users** - Real-time availability check with debounce, case-insensitive matching\n- [x] **Existing Google users logged in directly** - Auth callback checks for existing profile and redirects to home if username exists\n\n### Flow\n1. User clicks \"Continue with Google\" on login page\n2. Google OAuth flow completes and redirects to `/auth/callback`\n3. Callback checks if user has a profile with `full_name` (username)\n4. If no username → redirect to `/[locale]/complete-profile`\n5. If username exists → redirect to home page\n6. On complete-profile page, user sets their unique username with real-time availability checking\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":271,"cache_read_input_tokens":44244,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":271},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bf186ce8-bbc8-474d-8394-9852a20e107e","uuid":"7251aff6-d924-49f4-bf5b-c7f9810b3f68"}
